<title>MALAYSIA: Maybank to sign Philippines bank deal on April 7.</title>
<headline>Maybank to sign Philippines bank deal on April 7.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malayan Banking Corp Bhd (Maybank) said it will be issued with a notice of award by Philippine National Bank for its planned acquisition of PNB-Republic Bank on April 7.</p>
<p>In a statement received on Thursday, Maybank said it will sign a memorandum of agreement on the Philippine bank's acquisition from PNB on April 7 in Manila</p>
<p>Maybank, Malaysia's largest banking group, has previously said it has received approval from the board of directors of PNB to buy 60 percent of PNB-Republic.</p>
</text>
